    {
      "name": "Follicle Germination",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Hundreds of wirelike nerve endings erupt from the corzador's head in a 30ft Type:emanation. Each non-corzadai in the area must succeed at a DC 18 Reflex Saving Throw save or be instantly observed by all corzadais within 100 feet. Corzadais in the area gain a +1 circumstance bonus to attack and damage rolls against the detected creatures as long as the targets remain in the emanation. The corzador's emanation remains in effect until it takes a move action to leave its current space.</p>\n<p>Effect: Follicle Germination</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Shrieking Utricle",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A non-corzadai creature moves within the corzador's active Follicle Germination</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The corzador emits a high-pitched shriek. All non-corzadai creatures within the corzador's Follicle Emanation take 2d8 Sonic Damage damage with a Basic DC 18 Fortitude Saving Throw save.</p>",
